**Suggested fix, measured, test suite not run**

Consult the enclosing namespaces, innermost first, but only when the existing scopes know nothing about the name. A name that resolves today keeps exactly the same result:

```diff
--- a/graphify/extractors/csharp.py
+++ b/graphify/extractors/csharp.py
@@ -321,6 +321,15 @@
